    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">unlock the Elements</h2>NATURE'S ELEMENT is a fighting game where you control the natural elements. By using specific gestures in Virtual Reality you can summon, control, and reflect the elements around you, bending them to your will.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477040/extras/7604fac72f6b25f0c01615405598b0b7.poster.avif?t=1696631709\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477040/extras/7604fac72f6b25f0c01615405598b0b7.webm?t=1696631709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477040/extras/7604fac72f6b25f0c01615405598b0b7.mp4?t=1696631709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Mother Nature has assigned you as the defender of the &quot;Nature Gate&quot; - a portal between the physical world and her domain!<br>You must use your new elemental powers of Air, Earth, Water, and Fire to defend the gate from your enemies - lest they break the link between Mother Nature and the physical world!<br><br>As you master your abilities you will discover new moves, control the environment around you , and strengthen your abilities as you prepare to take on hidden evil!<br><br>Learn the movements, and their effects, and defend the world in Nature's Element!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">unlock the Elements</h2>NATURE'S ELEMENT is a fighting game where you control the natural elements. By using specific gestures in Virtual Reality you can summon, control, and reflect the elements around you, bending them to your will.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477040/extras/7604fac72f6b25f0c01615405598b0b7.poster.avif?t=1696631709\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477040/extras/7604fac72f6b25f0c01615405598b0b7.webm?t=1696631709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477040/extras/7604fac72f6b25f0c01615405598b0b7.mp4?t=1696631709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Mother Nature has assigned you as the defender of the &quot;Nature Gate&quot; - a portal between the physical world and her domain!<br>You must use your new elemental powers of Air, Earth, Water, and Fire to defend the gate from your enemies - lest they break the link between Mother Nature and the physical world!<br><br>As you master your abilities you will discover new moves, control the environment around you , and strengthen your abilities as you prepare to take on hidden evil!<br><br>Learn the movements, and their effects, and defend the world in Nature's Element!",
    "short_description": "Defend Mother Nature's Realm! Become the &quot;Element&quot; and unlock the power of Air, Water, Earth, and Fire as you punch, pull, push, block, and redirect elemental chaos to stop your enemies from destroying the Natural realm!",
